WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
We are Team Juxtacrop, from Uruguay.

00:02.370 --> 00:04.300
Every meal begins in a field.

00:04.340 --> 00:06.200
Agriculture feeds our communities,

00:06.240 --> 00:10.400
but farmers must make decisions months before
they know what the weather will bring.

00:10.540 --> 00:11.700
Meet juxtacrop:

00:11.740 --> 00:14.000
prepare for more than one future.

00:14.100 --> 00:17.150
Farmers map their fields and compare rotations

00:17.220 --> 00:20.550
using their knowledge and open NASA data on climate,

00:20.590 --> 00:24.000
rainfall, soil moisture, and vegetation.

00:24.030 --> 00:26.100
We reveal the risks and trade-offs,

00:26.180 --> 00:29.640
helping farmers protect their soil
and the future growing from it.
